==Battleground==
*1 [[Queen B]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Bakoo]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Bakoo]] spawns after 63.33 seconds<sup>1,900f</sup>.
*1 [[Bakoo]] spawns after 116.67 seconds<sup>3,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Duche]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*3 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage can be cleared by using [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and Research Power combos, with Attack Up ones being suitable alongside Research Power if one does not have enough Research Power [[Cat Combo]]. Once you have enough cash, summon a well-timed [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and the stage is all but won.

